        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FXILqfok5hL-R_3xlYMs-6" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 248, 245); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;IBM Plex Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(74, 69, 62);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;&quot;&gt;rôle privilégié&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;IBM Plex Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 248, 245); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 26px 48px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(59, 55, 48);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;Apple-interchange-newline&quot;&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="150" x="570" y="885" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FXILqfok5hL-R_3xlYMs-7" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 248, 245); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-family: &amp;quot;IBM Plex Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(109, 103, 94);&quot;&gt;Traitements automatiques (non modélisés en cas)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(59, 55, 48); font-family: &amp;quot;IBM Plex Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 248, 245); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;US8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;— la priorité est calculée par le système à la création du ticket, à partir de impact × urgence ; jamais saisie. Post-condition de US3.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(59, 55, 48); font-family: &amp;quot;IBM Plex Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 248, 245); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;US9&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;— chaque événement métier du cycle de vie est journalisé automatiquement dans MongoDB et l&#39;historique est relu dans le détail du ticket. Post-condition de US3 et US7, ainsi que de US12 si le bonus est implémenté&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="137.5" width="475" x="800" y="752.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FXILqfok5hL-R_3xlYMs-8" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 248, 245); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-family: &amp;quot;IBM Plex Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(109, 103, 94);&quot;&gt;Règles de lecture&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(59, 55, 48); font-family: &amp;quot;IBM Plex Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 248, 245); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Aucune généralisation entre acteurs : USER, TECHNICIAN et ADMIN sont associés individuellement à US3, US4 et US6.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(59, 55, 48); font-family: &amp;quot;IBM Plex Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 248, 245); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;ADMIN a la même portée de lecture que TECHNICIAN (US5) mais aucun droit de prise en charge ni de changement de statut (US7).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(59, 55, 48); font-family: &amp;quot;IBM Plex Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 248, 245); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;US12 — un ticket fermé peut être rouvert par son créateur ou par un TECHNICIAN.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="470" x="800" y="910" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
